%SIXMD 1
# @?ASMUTILS - OPTIONAL PDP-6 ASSEMBLER UTILITIES

## DESCRIPTION

ASMUTILS IS A SOURCE-ONLY COLLECTION OF SMALL DAIMOS UTILITIES IMPLEMENTED
ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER. THE PACKAGE IS BUILT WITH DAS AND INSTALLS ITS
EXECUTABLES IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC, MANUALS IN /OPTION/BASE/MANUAL/ASMUTILS,
AND SOURCES IN /OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS.

THE SHARED BASE.S FILE CONTAINS CURRENT DAIMOS MONITOR-UUO VENEERS. S6REC.S
CONTAINS THE RECORD-TEXT SUPPORT USED BY THE TEXT FILTERS.

## BUILD

THE NATIVE MAKEFILE IS /OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/MAKEFILE. USE MAKE ALL OR
MAKE INSTALL. ALL PROGRAMS ARE ASSEMBLED NATIVELY BY DAS IN STRICT BASE MODE.
THE BUILD PRODUCTS USE THEIR FINAL EXTENSIONLESS COMMAND NAMES; DXR IS THE
EXECUTABLE FILE FORMAT, NOT A REQUIRED FILENAME SUFFIX.

